==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=the [[triangle]] [[inequality]]|-}}

{{wikipedia}}

# {{label|en|analysis}} The [[inequality]] that states that the [[magnitude]] of the [[sum]] of two [[vector]]s is less than or equal to the sum of the magnitudes of the vectors, or any equivalent inequality in other [[space]]s.

